    <string name="context_probe_intro">This finds the largest context %1$s can use on this phone.\n\nClose other apps first so more memory is free. The chat model is unloaded, then the test loads it several times at bigger sizes and fills the context each time. It takes a few minutes and the phone may get warm.\n\nIf a size is too big, only the test stops; the app keeps running.</string>
